<figure class="r40-queue" data-r40-queue aria-labelledby="r40-queue-title">
 <figcaption id="r40-queue-title"><span>Figure 1</span> A reader can wait behind a change that has not begun</figcaption>
 <p class="scope">Illustrative steps from the observed lock dependency · vertical position is order, not duration</p>
 <div class="lanes">
  <section><p class="lane-title">Earlier report</p><p class="operation"><code>BEGIN; SELECT …</code></p><div class="state" data-live data-holder></div></section>
  <section><p class="lane-title">Schema session</p><p class="operation"><code>ALTER TABLE …</code></p><div class="state" data-live data-ddl></div></section>
  <section><p class="lane-title">New reader</p><p class="operation"><code>SELECT count(*)</code></p><div class="state" data-live data-reader></div></section>
 </div>
 <div class="dependencies" data-live data-dependencies></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-live data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div class="controls"><fieldset><legend>DDL wait policy</legend><label><input type="radio" name="r40-budget" value="bounded" checked /> Lock timeout</label><label><input type="radio" name="r40-budget" value="open" /> Keep waiting</label></fieldset>
 <div class="buttons"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step aria-label="Step"></span></div><div class="hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div>
 <details><summary>The complete dependency, as text</summary><p>The report retains AccessShareLock until its transaction ends. ALTER TABLE requests AccessExclusiveLock and waits for the report. A later reader's AccessShareLock is compatible with the report, but queues behind the earlier incompatible DDL request. A lock timeout removes the DDL request; the reader can proceed while the report remains open. The schema session must roll back its failed transaction before reuse.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-r40-queue]').forEach(root=>{
  const holder=root.querySelector('[data-holder]'); const ddl=root.querySelector('[data-ddl]');const reader=root.querySelector('[data-reader]');const dependency=root.querySelector('[data-dependencies]'); const explanation=root.querySelector('[data-explanation]');
  const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>5,draw:(n)=>{
   const bounded=root.querySelector('input:checked').value==='bounded';
   const states=[['Transaction open','Not submitted','Not submitted'],['Transaction open','Waiting for report','Not submitted'],['Transaction open','Waiting for report','Waiting behind DDL'],['Transaction still open',bounded?'55P03 · lock timeout':'Still waiting',bounded?'Reads five lines':'Still waiting'],['Transaction still open',bounded?'Rolled back · retry later':'Still waiting',bounded?'Request finished':'Still waiting']];
   [holder,ddl,reader].forEach((node,i)=>{node.textContent=states[n][i];node.dataset.wait=String(states[n][i].includes('waiting')||states[n][i].includes('Waiting'));});
   dependency.textContent=n===0?'No dependency yet':n===1?'DDL waits for report':n===2||(!bounded&&n>2)?'Reader waits for DDL → DDL waits for report':'DDL request removed · reader no longer waits';
   explanation.textContent=[
    'A report has read order_items inside an open transaction. Its AccessShareLock survives the completed SELECT.',
    'ALTER TABLE needs AccessExclusiveLock. The report prevents that grant, so no schema change has happened yet.',
    'The new reader could share with the report. It nevertheless waits behind the earlier incompatible ALTER TABLE request.',
    bounded?'The DDL lock budget expires. PostgreSQL removes that request, and the reader proceeds. The report never had to finish.':'With no timeout or cancellation, both requests remain dependent on the report. No amount of waiting makes this a fast metadata operation.',
    bounded?'The schema session rolls back its failed transaction. The column was not installed; the migration must recheck its stage before a later retry.':'This chosen schedule keeps the report open. To make progress, an owner must finish that transaction or remove the waiting schema request.'
   ][n];
  }});
  root.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render()));
 });
</script>
<style>
.r40-queue{margin:2.5rem 0;font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.2rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.75rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}.scope{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.lanes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem}.lanes section{margin:0;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:1rem .8rem}.lanes .lane-title{font:600 .95rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);margin:0}.operation{font-size:.8rem;min-height:3rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.state{min-height:4.5rem;border:2px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.7rem;display:flex;align-items:center}.state[data-wait=true]{border-style:dashed}.dependencies{border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:1rem 0;font-weight:600;min-height:4.5rem}.explanation{min-height:7rem;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding-left:1rem}.controls{background:var(--color-surface-alt);padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}fieldset{border:0;margin:0 0 1rem;padding:0;display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap}legend{font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem}.buttons{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}button{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.45rem .65rem;border-radius:.25rem;cursor:pointer}button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.55}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.hold{height:3px;margin-top:.6rem;background:var(--color-surface)}.hold span{height:100%;display:block;background:var(--color-accent);width:0}details{margin-top:.8rem}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--color-accent)}@media(max-width:550px){.lanes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lanes section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.lanes .lane-title{grid-column:1}.operation{grid-column:1;min-height:0;margin:0}.state{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;min-height:4rem}.explanation{min-height:10rem}}
</style>
